/// sets the status of the stream back to ACTIVE . Depending on the size of
/// the stream, the scaling action could take a few minutes to complete. You
/// can continue to read and write data to your stream while its status is
/// UPDATING . This operation is only supported for data streams with the
/// on-demand capacity mode in accounts that have
/// MinimumThroughputBillingCommitment enabled. Provisioned capacity mode
/// streams do not support warm throughput configuration. To release excess
